# Line endings are part of the data in this repository: Kit manifests and Dockerfiles are linted line by line, shared
# test vectors are compared byte for byte, and shell scripts and Dockerfiles break with CRLF inside Linux containers.
# A Windows checkout (autocrlf=true by default in Git for Windows and on windows-latest runners) must not change them.
# Cross-platform plan W9 / W15. Only the listed types are pinned, so nothing already committed is renormalised.
*.py      text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.jsonl   text eol=lf
*.toml    text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.ts      text eol=lf
*.tsx     text eol=lf
*.mjs     text eol=lf
*.js      text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.ps1     text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile.* text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf
*.sol     text eol=lf
